# Never commit these
*.env
.env*
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/*password*
**/*.ocf
**/portal-access.md

# Scratch
work/
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp

# CRM — generated daily brief + local run state (source of truth is crm/companies, crm/rfps)
crm/reports/
crm/.report_state.json

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node / Python
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# The sales website (plan/website.md) — Node build artefacts only. `site/public/data/` (the JSON
# data contract emitted by tools/site_data.py) IS committed deliberately: it is diffable and a
# `git diff` on it is a meaningful record of what a run changed.
site/node_modules/
site/dist/

# Stray files from tools that mangle Windows temp paths
Usersageha*

# Website build artifacts (the site is DERIVED — never a source of truth)
site/node_modules/
site/dist/
